                  <span><strong class="text-white font-semibold">Unlimited Pixel AI credits</strong></span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-tagline-2 text-white/60">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-green-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5 6.5-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                  <span>SSO, SAML, custom roles</span>
